{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-pi/src/project.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-15T18:25:10.595405Z","id":"f898c8ff78d6aae891ab51f1738d724137110ca0ff8a9bc144850fc33a01f937","body":{"detail":"Round robin pi -> copilot -> claude -> codex -> pi: ollama/gemma4 returned as anthropic/gemma4. The provider never enters the IR (Turn.model carries the model name only); Turn.extra[pi][api] is the only carrier and no other projector writes it. Either carry the provider in the IR (ProducerInfo or Turn.model as provider/model) or derive it from the model name. review/roundrobin.md, 2026-10-15.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":65},"end":{"line":65},"content_hash":"929101e16bdc3a92042e488c2f997314d0e839bcc5f1356ff04773dca3037e0c"},"summary":"the pi projector defaults the provider to anthropic, so a local ollama model comes back as anthropic/<model> after a round trip","tags":["review","roundtrip","defect-candidate","session:claude-code:7c8ae6d3-afd1-4605-913b-9fd31e45468f"]}}
